Subject: [PATCH] Include INTL in WorkBuddy system-first handling

Source: https://github.com/mmqz/cpa-multi-plugins/tree/v0.8.68
Source tarball SHA256: 6163f688bf902b7e366f4d4ca11ff674b1f042fd34d39e3289136fa87972e552
Consumer: manual WorkBuddy plugin build; not automatically deployed.
RETIRED 2026-10-19: upstream PR #42 merged (v0.8.71 / workbuddy 0.9.59) ships
the equivalent INTL system-first handling; production runs 0.9.60-local without
this patch. Kept as historical reference only -- do not replay.
(Retire condition was: the upstream release includes equivalent INTL handling.)

